            "description": {
              "content": "Poll a batch. Returns `status` (`running`/`done`/`error`), progress\n(`done`/`total`), and `results` — the finished items so far in the clean\nper-video shape. Results are small (no frames), so the full list is\nreturned every poll; a result appears once its video finishes verifying.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
